# Drift of Phantasms's transmute {1}{U}{U} (CR 702.53a): paying it and discarding the card from the hand searches the library
# for a card with the same mana value as the discarded card (3), reveals it and puts it into the hand. The cost is paid exactly
# with Blasted Landscape's {C} for the generic and two Mox Sapphires for the blue pips, and the pool ends empty; with a Mox Jet
# in place of the second Mox Sapphire the ability is not offered (a colored pip needs blue). Of a mana value 2, two 3s and a 5
# in the library only one card of mana value 3 may be found (a search for "a card"), and it is revealed.

